2 CONC ing that it would be against Dharma if he were to refuse her request, as she is desperate to have a child. He reluctantly agrees and they start to have sex, in the hope that she will conceive. In due course, Devayani gives birth t
2 CONC o two sons Yadu and Turvasu while Sharmishtha gives birth to three sons Druhyu, Anu and Puru.
