1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Trijada was the daughter of vibhishana-saramai pair. Ravana, the king of Ilangai/srilanka had appointed many female demons to safeguard Sita Mata. Trijada was one amongst those demons. Even though she was one among
2 CONC st the demons she was in unique with regards to her character and virtue. All other lady demon were frightening Sita Mata to marry Ravana. But Trijada was one who consoled Sita Mata saying that “Mata you need not worry. Ravana has
2 CONC  a curse and he won’t be even able to touch you without your consent.” Such kind of comforting words from Trijada kept Sita Mata’s hope alive. Trijada even tried to convince Ravana and others to send back Sita Mata to Lord Rama. T
2 CONC rijada used to warn the other lady demons when they tried to annoy Sita Mata.
2 CONT
2 CONT IN LANKA, Sita was spending time with the thoughts of Rama. Rakshasa ladies Tryakshi, Tristani, Ekapaada, Deerghajihva, Ajihva, Trijata, Ekalocana were sitting around Sita and guarding her. They are instigating Sita to marry Ravan
2 CONC a otherwise they will kill her and eat her.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sita was requesting them time and again that she will never thought about another man except Rama in her mind and requested them to kill her and relieve her from this agony. All the Rakshasa ladies except Trijata went to Ravana ab
2 CONC out this. 
2 CONT
2 CONT “Sita! You are not alone here. One Rakshasa called Avindhya likes your husband, Rama very much. He sent me here to look after your comforts. Rama and Lakshmana knew that Ravana abducted you. They met Sugreeva and made friendship w
2 CONC ith him. Sugreeva is making arrangements for your search. On account of Rambha, Nala koobara cursed Ravana that he should not touch any other lady against her will. Hence Ravana will never molest you.
2 CONT
2 CONT Last night, I got a dream. In that dream, Ravana, applied oil to his body, with disturbed hair, was proceeding southwards, on a chariot driven by donkeys. He was surrounded by Kumbhakarna and other Rakshasas, with disturbed hair, 
2 CONC and without clothes. All are proceeding towards south. Vibheeshana, decorated with white flowers, with a white umbrella, was sitting on a white hill with his ministers. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I also saw Rama in my dream. Rama was going on a big elephant along with Lakshmana consuming sweet milk. My dream will become true. You will join your husband soon” said Trijata. On hearing the consoling words of Trijata, the agon
2 CONC y of Sita subsided to some extent.
