2 CONC i sar- gacetama, seda doesoen Bener, Bagoes Kalman goemanti kang marasepoen, nama Adipati #argacetama kaping 2 kalih, Boe- pati #irasaba, idin sangking Kangdjeng Boalten Padjang, ngalih kradjan dateng ing Banjoemas, ladjang karan 
