2 CONT * Sannati Stupa, Karnataka, India: The only known sculptural depiction of Ashoka
2 CONT * Mir Rukun Stupa Nawabshah, Pakistan
2 CONT
2 CONT ''In art, film and literature''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Jaishankar Prasad, composed Ashoka ki Chinta (Ashoka's Anxiety), a poem that portrays Ashoka’s feelings during the war of Kalinga.
2 CONT * Ashok Kumar is a 1941 Tamil film directed by Raja Chandrasekhar. The film stars Chittor V. Nagaiah as Ashoka.
2 CONT * Uttar-Priyadarshi (The Final Beatitude) a verse-play written by poet Agyeya, depicting his redemption, was adapted to stage in 1996 by theatre director, Ratan Thiyam and has since been performed in many parts of the world.
2 CONT * In 1973, Amar Chitra Katha released a graphic novel based on the life of Ashoka.
2 CONT * In Piers Anthony’s series of space opera novels, the main character mentions Ashoka as a model for administrators to strive for.
2 CONT * Aśoka is a 2001 epic Indian historical drama film directed and co-written by Santosh Sivan. The films stars Shahrukh Khan as Ashoka.
2 CONT * In 2002, Mason Jennings released the song "Emperor Ashoka" on his Living in the Moment EP. It is based on the life of Ashoka.
2 CONT * In 2013, Christopher C. Doyle released his debut novel, The Mahabharata Secret, where he wrote about Ashoka hiding a dangerous secret for the well-being of India.
2 CONT * In 2014, The Emperor's Riddles, a fiction mystery thriller novel by Satyarth Nayak traced the evolution of Ashoka and his esoteric legend of the Nine Unknown Men.
2 CONT * In 2015, Chakravartin Ashoka Samrat, a television serial by Ashok Banker based on the life of Ashoka is currently airing on Colors TV. Siddharth Nigam is playing Ashoka
2 CONT * The Legend of Kunal is an upcoming film based on the life of Kunal, the son of the Indian emperor Ashoka. The movie will be directed by Chandraprakash Dwivedi. The role of Ashoka is played by Amitabh Bachchan, and the role of Ku
2 CONC nal is played by Arjun Rampal.
2 CONT
