2 ADDR
3 CITY Kartasura
3 STAE Central Java
3 CTRY Indonesia
1 BURI
2 DATE 20 APR 1726
2 PLAC Pakubuwanan, Imogiri
2 ADDR
3 STAE Yogyakarta
3 CTRY Bantul
1 DEAT
2 DATE 20 APR 1726
