1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Note on 20 Dec 2014:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''This ancestor path of Rd Dmg Soema Taroena or Rd Suradipradja Anom is Yudhi version.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Rd Soeradipradja children: 1. Rd Suradipradja Anom (Rd Dmg Suma Taruna) 2. Rd Natadipradja 3. NR Saripaningsih
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''Patih Karawang.'''<br/>
2 CONT '''Note on 20 Dec 2014:'''<br/>
2 CONT '''Merged with Yudhi path: Rd Suradipradja Anom (Rd Dmg Suma Taruna), 20 Dec 2014.'''<br/>
2 CONT '''So the name in Geni Rd Dmg Soema Taroena or Rd Suradipradja Anom, and then split the fathers.'''<br/>
2 CONT <br/>'''Rd Dmg Soema Taroena was the only child in Sam version (RKSDP):'''<br/>
2 CONT '''Rd Dmg Soema Taroena or Rd Suradipradja Anom was the first child in Yudhi version, his younger siblings are:''' <br/>
2 CONT *2. Rd Natadipradja
2 CONT *3. NR Saripaningsih married to Rd Dmg Wangsadipradja
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Rd Dmg Soema Taroena children in Sam version (RKSDP):'''
2 CONT * 1. Rd Dmg Soema Pradja
2 CONT * 2. Mas Raksa Pradja
2 CONT * 3. Rd Dmg Soema Manggala
2 CONT * 4. NM Natawoelan
2 CONT * 5. Rd Bradja Di Rana
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Rd Dmg Soema Taroena or Rd Suradipradja Anom children in Yudhi version:'''
2 CONT * 1. Rd Dmg Soema Pradja
2 CONT * 2. Rd Soeria di Pradja
2 CONT * 3. Rd Puradipradja
2 CONT * 4. NR Adiaresmi
2 CONT * 5. NR Djuwita
2 CONT * 6. Rd Natadisastra
2 CONT * 7. Rd Tjakrawinata
2 CONT * 8. Rd Argawinata
2 CONT * 9. Rd Ismaja
2 CONT * 10. Rd Natawidjaja
2 CONT * 11. NR Aisah
2 CONT * 12. NR Majakaningrat
