1 NOTE {geni:about_me} King Revatha  was living in an island near Dwaraka.  He belonged to Sathyuga and wanted a daughter to be married to a Deva who becomes a kshatriya. By the time he goes to Deva loka and returns back, many yugas pass
2 CONC .  In the Sathyuga, men and women were of larger physical stature.  Now, when he returned, he sees his daughter Revathi too huge in size and height that he can't find any man on earth to marry her. When Krishna and Balarama move a
2 CONC long with Yadava clan to Dwaraka, they see this King and then Balarama(who himself is very huge and tall but still has to lift his head to see her) uses his plough(his weapon for agriculture and fighting) to bring down Revathi.  T
2 CONC hen Krishna gets him married to Revathi.
